"""One-colour marks for the lab's tool tiles, stack chips and contact buttons.

Copied as path data so the profile never fetches icons at render time. Every mark
is drawn in a single theme colour, never in brand colours.

- Simple Icons 13.21.0 (CC0 1.0)
- Devicon 2.17.0, plain variant (MIT)
- Phosphor Icons 2.1.1, bold weight (MIT); generic glyphs for tools without a one-colour logo

Brand marks stay unaltered apart from colour. WSL, UCSF ChimeraX, React Three
Fiber and Drei have no official one-colour mark, so they use generic glyphs.
"""

